  "modification_guides": [
    {
      "question": "登录按钮点击后经过哪些函数和模块？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "CLoginIn.OnMessage(2)仅在not misc.IsTWServer()内检查chk_agree；对象存在且未选中才提示并return。其余情况调用LoginOk：非空/密码长度/账号非纯数字校验后C2SLoginIn，再设置错误回调。OnLogin是另一个入口，LoginIn存在才SaveAccount；不能由此证明提交即成功或直接调用OnLogin。RandomConnect在OneoffLogin/OneoffLogin2内，不串入普通按钮链。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "message2",
          "loginok",
          "onlogin",
          "saveaccount",
          "autologin"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "注册逻辑与布局分别在哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "首页OnMessage(2)在IsTWServer()真时打开外部REGISTER_URL（按g_LangVersion分支）；仅非TW才隐藏首页并register.Show(True)->Step(0)。register各CRegPanel与回调负责逻辑，布局reg1/reg2/reg3/reg4/reg5.dlg，CConfirm另用login/confirm.dlg。confirm是独立确认入口，不能当成Step序列；未验证布局资源内容或注册服务可用。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mp_entry",
          "rg_confirm",
          "rg_reg1",
          "rg_reg2",
          "rg_reg2_2980",
          "rg_panels34",
          "rg_stepshow"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "main.py如何启动、运行主循环、切换战斗和退出？",
